Category: IT Services

Location: Fort Western Province Sri Lanka

We are urgently looking for a REMOTE (Senior) Business Intelligence Developer for an international organization in Rome, Italy. Candidates need to be fluent in English. All positions are long-term. This position is open for freelancers and employees.

During the corona crisis, interviews will be done through WEBEX, and travel is not required for the interviews.

Candidates need to be able to work normal office hours in Rome, Italy.

Tasks and Responsibilities:

• Analysis, design, development, deployment, and testing of web dashboards;

• These web dashboards will display the information at a spatial dashboard by linking data between different dashboard charts and displaying the spatial information on a map viewer;

• The dashboard will include other multiple maps with data at the country level, displaying it in an integrated and interactive way;

• These tasks will be performed using the Tableau tool, on the development, testing, and production environments;

• The data will be loaded in the CKAN tool and will be used by configuring and connecting Tableau, developing specific connectors if necessary.

• The web pages will incorporate the dashboard information and will be implemented following in alignment with the hand-in-hand product, using React JS for the development.

• The analysis of the web traffic on the site will be done using Google Analytics.

Profile:

• Bachelor or master degree;

• +10 years of professional experience as a web developer;

• Experience with development of dashboards combining business information with spatial data;

• Experience in the extraction, loading, and transformation of data in order to adapt it to reports and dashboards combined with spatial data;

• Experience with Tableau, CKAN, and React.JS is an advantage;

Offered:

• A Challenging role for an international organization;

• Attractive salary package;

Interested:

If you have the right profile, you have the opportunity to be a part of a dynamic team working for a company with global exposure, providing you a great working environment and ample space to learn and develop. If you are ready to grab this opportunity, please forward your CV to or call us on +94 114312515 for more information.

